# Intent: Train 4 item 6, more face styles as data, five more screen languages, caption size. Six new styles (round, cat, robot, sleepy, retro_pixel, heart_eyes) are rows of data: eye roundness, gap, lid limit and drawn extras (cat ears and whiskers, a robot antenna and bolts, heart eyes), all plain rounded rectangles; heart eyes hide in a mute, vision-off or quiet look. The saved face record is version 2 (a caption size byte; version 1 records still load). Screen words (clock date line, timer chip words) in French, German, Portuguese and Italian, plain ASCII because the screen font has no accents ('aou', 'fev'); the language is part of the face config (en, es, fr, de, pt, it) and the Wi-Fi setup page still reads Spanish or English. Caption size small, medium or large uses the three Latin sizes the build already has. The face config reports the feature words packs and langs6.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/stackchan/avatar/skins/default/ and firmware/main/hal/maipai_face*.h of this tree (patches F01 to F06)
# Check after a flash: self.face.set_config style cat draws ears and whiskers, robot an antenna, heart_eyes hearts over the eyes (hidden while muted); caption_size large makes the words bigger; lang de shows 'Mi 24 Dez' on the clock face; an unknown style, size or language gets a plain error and changes nothing; after the flash the old settings still load.
# Kconfig: MAIPAI_FACE_PACKS (default y); off keeps classic, big_eyes and minimal and one caption size.
diff --git a/firmware/main/Kconfig.projbuild b/firmware/main/Kconfig.projbuild
--- a/firmware/main/Kconfig.projbuild
+++ b/firmware/main/Kconfig.projbuild
@@ -185,6 +185,16 @@ config MAIPAI_VERSION
         Shows the firmware version; ten quick taps on it open the release tag, the image trust state, the slot and the
         free memory. Reads only. Off here: no page and no tool.
 
+config MAIPAI_FACE_PACKS
+    bool "Face style packs (round, cat, robot, sleepy, retro pixel, heart eyes) and caption size"
+    default y
+    depends on MAIPAI_FACE_CONFIG
+    help
+        Six more face styles as rows of data (eye roundness and gap, lid limit, drawn extras such as cat ears and
+        whiskers, a robot antenna or heart eyes) and a small, medium or large caption size. Extras are plain rounded
+        rectangles: no image, no font. A few objects exist only while a style with extras is chosen; heart eyes hide
+        in a mute, vision-off or quiet look. Off here: only classic, big_eyes and minimal, and one caption size.
+
